Database migrations for ReelSaver (Flask-Migrate + Alembic).

Common commands (run from backend/, with env vars loaded):

  flask db upgrade                 # apply all pending migrations
  flask db migrate -m "message"    # autogenerate a new migration from model changes
  flask db downgrade               # revert the last migration
  flask db current                 # show current revision

The Flask app is discovered via FLASK_APP=wsgi.py.
